From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hideoutgames <154709155+hideoutgames@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 01:40:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] edge: Live Activity start payload and APNs host fallback

Start pushes include aps.alert (Apple drops a start without one),
input-push-token, and a phase label. Push-to-start also runs on
awaitingInput, once per chat until the run ends, and that marker
survives DO hibernation. BadDeviceToken retries the other APNs host
before the token is pruned.
---
